    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "PolyBrute 12 User Manual 3.1.0",
      "notes": "MIDI CC chart (pages 132, 133 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/arturia/read-arturia-cc.mjs from polybrute-12_Manual_3_1_0_EN.pdf (sha256 82ddce8d640173e3073a651674da0e95b915f037bad7233f9a83c7085f908840), https://dl.arturia.net/products/polybrute-12/manual/polybrute-12_Manual_3_1_0_EN.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/arturia/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/arturia/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI CC chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart prints controller numbers only: every value is the controller's 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a waveform, an oscillator type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "Left out, the wheels, ribbon and pedals: CC 11 Exp 1, CC 4 Exp 2, CC 9 Ribbon, CC 1 Mod Wheel."
  ],
